<main role="main">
  <h1 class="visually-hidden">CVPR 2025 - Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition Conference</h1>

  <div class="row">
    <div class="col-sm-6 bigger-font">The IEEE/CVF Conference on Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition 2025</div>

    <div class="col-sm-6 bigger-font" role="contentinfo" aria-label="Conference date and location">
      Wed June 11th - Sun June 15th, 2025<br />
      at the Music City Center, Nashville TN <br /><br />
    </div>

    <div class="hidden">
      firstback
    </div>

    <div style="display: none" class="secondback"></div>

    <div class="col-sm-6">
      <div>
             <div>
    <p>The <strong>IEEE / CVF Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition Conference (CVPR)</strong> is the premier annual
        computer vision event comprising the main conference and several co-located workshops and short courses.   With
        its high quality and low cost, it provides an exceptional value for students, academics and industry
        researchers. 
    </p>

    <p><a class="btn btn-spacer btn-success" href="/Conferences/2025/Pricing2">Register</a> <a
            class="btn btn-spacer btn-success" href="/InvitationLetter">Invitation Letter</a></p>

    <hr>
    <p><a class="btn btn-lg btn-primary btn-spacer" href="/virtual/2025/index.html">Conference Site</a></p>

    <hr>
    <p><a class="btn btn-lg btn-spacer btn-success"
          href="https://media.eventhosts.cc/Conferences/CVPR2025/CVPR_main_conf_2025.pdf">Main Conference Program
        PDF</a> <a class="btn btn-lg btn-spacer btn-success"
                   href="https://media.eventhosts.cc/Conferences/CVPR2025/CVPR_Workshops_Tutorials_2025.pdf">Workshops
        &amp; Tutorials Program PDF</a></p>
    <p><a class="btn btn-lg btn-spacer btn-primary"
          href="/Conferences/2025/BestPapersDemos">Best Papers and Best Demos</a>
    </p>
    <p><a class="btn btn-primary btn-spacer" href="/Conferences/2025/KeynotesAndPanels">Keynotes</a> <a
            class="btn btn-primary btn-spacer" href="/virtual/2025/events/tutorial">Tutorials</a> <a
            class="btn btn-primary btn-spacer" href="/virtual/2025/events/workshop">Workshops</a> <a
            class="btn btn-primary btn-spacer" href="/Conferences/2025/AcceptedPapers">Accepted Papers</a> <a
            class="btn btn-primary btn-spacer"
            href="https://cvpr.thecvf.com/virtual/2025/calendar?filter_events=Art+Program&amp;filter_rooms=">Art
        Program</a> <a class="btn btn-primary btn-spacer" href="https://openaccess.thecvf.com/CVPR2025">2025
        Proceedings</a><a class="btn btn-primary btn-spacer" href="/Conferences/2025/News">News</a></p>

    <p>Video of recorded events will appear on this page as is it processed.  Currently the Tutorials and Keynotes are
        available. Workshop are still in process.  Other events were not recorded.
    </p>

    <p><a class="btn btn-primary btn-spacer" href="/Conferences/2025/Videos">Video Recordings</a> <a
            class="btn btn-primary btn-spacer" href="https://lillieelliotphotography.pixieset.com/cvprnashville2025/">Photos
        from CVPR 25</a></p>
</div>
