<h2>Event Changes:</h2>

<ul>
	<li>[Art Program] Panel Discussions (Sat, Sun 13:30) have moved to room 207 A-D. </li>
	<li>[Tutorial] <a href="/virtual/2025/tutorial/35920">Multimodal Mathematical Reasoning: Frontiers in Integrating Vision, Language, and Symbolic Representations</a> is now in Room 202 C.</li>
	<li>[Workshop] <a href="/virtual/2025/workshop/32314">Exploring the Next Generation of Data</a> moved from Thursday June 12 to Wednesday June 11.  Room 201 B.</li>
	<li>[Workshop] <a href="http://Workshop%20on%20Perception%20for%20Industrial%20Robotics%20Automation">Workshop on Perception for Industrial Robotics Automation</a> starts at 13:00 rather than 14:00.</li>
	<li>[Workshop] <a href="/virtual/2025/tutorial/35901">Tackling 3D Deep Learning, Gaussian Splats and Physics Simulation with NVIDIA Kaolin Library, a Hands-On Lab</a> starts at 9:00 rather than 8:00.</li>
	<li>[Workshop]: <a href="/virtual/2025/workshop/32297">Real-to-Sim: Bridging the Gap between Neural Rendering and Robot Learning</a> moved from Wednesday June 11 to Thursday June 12 P.M.</li>
</ul>

